   {
    "statement": "iPhone 12 Pro Max with normal BATT_VCC (3.7–4.0 V) and normal battery FPC diode readings but no battery detection had battery I2C SDA/SCL at about 0.2 V instead of 1.8 V, pulled low by level translator U2470.",
    "evidence": "Problem description.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   },
   {
    "statement": "Replacing U2470 restores ~1.8 V on the battery I2C lines and normal charging.",
    "evidence": "Repair steps.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   }
  ],
  "procedure": [
   "Measure BATT_VCC at the connector (3.7–4.0 V).",
   "Diode-check battery FPC.",
   "Measure I2C SDA/SCL voltage (expect ~1.8 V).",
   "Replace U2470 if pulled low; re-measure."
  ],
